I've added the QueryNormalizerProvider and wrapped it around our existing components. The provider requires a queryClient instance, which I've created using QueryClient from @tanstack/react-query. This should resolve the error about missing QueryNormalizer context.

The providers are now properly nested:
1. QueryNormalizerProvider (outermost)
2. ScopeProvider
3. Bubble component (innermost)

This setup should provide all the necessary context that the Bubble component and its children need. Let me know if you encounter any other errors.

